{"id":"type-piecewise-function","html":"<section id=\"features\"><h2>题型特征</h2><ul><li><p>给出分段函数以及等式或不等式，要求全部输入；各段分别求解，再检查本段范围。</p></li><li><p>由函数值反求输入或解不等式时，各段结果先与本段范围取交，再合并。</p></li><li><p>值域由各段实际输出取并；给定整体值域求参数时，同时检查覆盖与不越界。</p></li><li><p>阶梯收费须区分超出部分与全部用量，建模时累计前段费用。</p></li></ul></section><section id=\"choose\"><h2>怎么选方法</h2><h3>可选用的方法</h3><div class=\"choose-methods\"><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-piecewise-equation/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段解方程法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>已知分段函数及 f(x)=c，求全部实数输入。</p><p>每段列方程、检查该段范围，再合并保留的解。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-piecewise-inequality/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段解不等式法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>已知分段函数及 f(x) 与常数或 f(c) 的大小关系，求全部实数输入。</p><p>先确定比较值，逐段解不等式并与本段范围取交，最后合并。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-piecewise-range-parameter/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段值域求参法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>原分段式、给定完整值域和待求参数。</p><p>先求不含参段值域，再判断含参段要不越界还是补齐，最后求参数范围。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-piecewise-modeling/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段建模法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>原题明确给出的超出部分阶梯单价、分界点和单位。</p><p>按规则分档，每档累计前档费用与本档新增费用，再写成分段函数。</p></article></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>说明与题例</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 分段解方程并筛选根</h3><p class=\"problem\">已知 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2+1,&amp;x&gt;0\\\\-2x+2,&amp;x\\le0\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"he